---
// Footer.astro - Comprehensive footer with local Varanasi office credentials & quick links
---

<footer class="bg-[#0A192C] text-white/70 text-sm border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10">
      
      <!-- Brand & Office details -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <a href="#" class="inline-block">
          <img
            src="/logo.png"
            alt="Wave Power Solar"
            class="h-10 w-auto object-contain filter drop-shadow brightness-110"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Wave Power Solar is Eastern Uttar Pradesh's leading rooftop solar engineering firm. Authorized channel partner under PM Surya Ghar Muft Bijli Yojana.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-white/60">
          <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#EA6B1F]">📍</span>
            <span><strong>Head Office:</strong> B-38/12 Mahmoorganj Road, Near Rathyatra, Varanasi, UP 221010</span>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#EA6B1F]">📞</span>
            <span><strong>Helpline:</strong> +91 94150 12345 / 0542-2345678</span>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#EA6B1F]">✉️</span>
            <span><strong>Email:</strong> contact@wavepowersolar.in</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">The Story</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#problem" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">The Summer Problem</a></li>
          <li><a href="#idea" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">The Free Sunlight Idea</a></li>
          <li><a href="#process" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">4-Step Installation Process</a></li>
          <li><a href="#results" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Savings & Performance Stats</a></li>
          <li><a href="#stories" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Purvanchal Customer Stories</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Service Areas -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">Service Districts</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#coverage" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Varanasi Rooftop Solar</a></li>
          <li><a href="#coverage" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Mirzapur Solar Installations</a></li>
          <li><a href="#coverage" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Prayagraj Commercial & Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="#coverage" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Bhadohi Industrial Solar</a></li>
          <li><a href="#coverage" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Chandauli & Mughalsarai</a></li>
          <li><a href="#coverage" class="hover:text-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">Jaunpur & Ghazipur</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Government Scheme & Discom -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">Government Subsidy</h4>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
          <p class="text-white/60">
            Get up to ₹78,000 direct bank transfer via PM Surya Ghar Muft Bijli Yojana for 1 kW - 3 kW residential rooftop installations.
          </p>
          <a
            href="#quote-form"
            class="inline-block text-[#EA6B1F] font-semibold hover:underline"
          >
            Check Subsidy Eligibility →
          </a>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[11px] text-white/80">
              UPPCL Discom Approved
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright & Disclaimers -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-white/50">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Wave Power Solar. All rights reserved. Registered with MNRE & UPPCL.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Subsidy Guidelines</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
